    WHY STARTER AND NOT AGPLv3: the AGPL option would force this application to be offered
    under AGPL-compatible terms once distributed, and AGPL GRANTS RECIPIENTS COMMERCIAL
    RIGHTS. That is the exact opposite of LICENSE §2. AGPLv3 is therefore expressly NOT
